      "date": "2026-03-10T16:05:00.000Z",
      "title": "Enbee Trade and Finance Limited Announces the Cessation of Jayesh Gulabbhai Patel as an Independent Director of the Company, Effective 10 March, 2026",
      "body": "Enbee Trade and Finance Limited, at its board meeting held on March 10, 2026, announced that the second consecutive term of appointment of Jayesh Gulabbhai Patel as Non-Executive Independent Director of the Company will end on 10 March, 2026. Consequently, Mr. Jayesh Gulabbhai Patel will cease to be Independent Director of the Company with effect from close of business hours on 10 March, 2026.",
